{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploring Friscott is styled after the &quot;Choose Your Own Adventure&quot; type games. You are an adventurer going into Friscott Castle to see what treasures you can find within. Explore the castle, meet the residents, find treasure and more. Be mindful though, as the castle isn't normal, and there are things about it that might drive a person to madness. That, or it might spell your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trek inside and and try to get out with your life with as much treasure as you can find while interacting with a fun cast of characters within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It does contain mature content (like nudity), but there is no explicit content outside of written text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play time can range from 20-30 minutes to a couple of hours depending on how thorough you are.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668280?t=1745613291","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668280/bc11429fb06a07c9b30af75217baae9572d54679/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745613291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668280/cc299dfb0bc775a6ee237b87654b4645bb5ee5ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745613291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668280/cc299dfb0bc775a6ee237b87654b4645bb5ee5ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745613291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The mature content is mostly expressed through text. The only graphical representation of mature content is with naked character sprites, and the rest is expressed through text."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploring Friscott is styled after the &quot;Choose Your Own Adventure&quot; type games. You are an adventurer going into Friscott Castle to see what treasures you can find within. Explore the castle, meet the residents, find treasure and more. Be mindful though, as the castle isn't normal, and there are things about it that might drive a person to madness. That, or it might spell your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trek inside and and try to get out with your life with as much treasure as you can find while interacting with a fun cast of characters within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It does contain mature content (like nudity), but there is no explicit content outside of written text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play time can range from 20-30 minutes to a couple of hours depending on how thorough you are.</p>","developers":["WolfBite Interactice LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668280/9b68faba2696813fcef628e392e4ed64f39200bc/header.jpg?t=1745613291","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright WolfBite Interactive LLC 2024-Current Year.  All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux x86/x86_64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Exploring Friscott","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><s